This project is an independent Hono/Cloudflare implementation of the Bark
server protocol.

The default APNs provider configuration used to communicate with the official
Bark iOS application is taken from Finb/bark-server, licensed under the MIT
License: https://github.com/Finb/bark-server

Cloudflare behavior and compatibility were checked against cwxiaos/bark-worker:
https://github.com/cwxiaos/bark-worker
